    <guid isPermaLink="false">67bdf0bb606e5c5940d53630</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Feb 2025 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期风格：意识流式周末闲聊</span></p><span></span><p><span>闲聊人：</span></p><span></span><p><span>梧桐树下小洋房里的Angela</span></p><span></span><p><span>自媒体人小鸣</span></p><span></span><p><span>划重点：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">3:21</a> 策略人的AI调教</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">4:20</a> 假报告，假链接，假数据……AI编故事比老板画饼更逼真</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="448">7:28</a> 人类的终极底牌：信任崩塌后，AI拿什么和真人PK？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">11:54</a> 算法的投喂VS书店探险：我们正在吞食精神预制菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="927">15:27</a> 训练AI=自掘坟墓？职场恐怖片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1015">16:55</a> AI审阅的AB面：逻辑捕手×语境文盲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> AI像镜子，它的上限取决于你的上限</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1566">26:06</a> 超越不了AI，我的生命体验就没有意义吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1689">28:09</a> AI时代的“主体性价值”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1947">32:27</a> AI焦虑症解药：狂薅天才羊毛</span></p>]]></description>
