  <item>
    <title>老友记 失眠时的白噪音，留学时的六个朋友</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6227869d245671dff59f338a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6227869d245671dff59f338a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Mar 2022 16:38:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>为什么有这一期：两个新朋友相遇在老友记主题咖啡厅，边看边异口同声地剧透下一句台词，才发现彼此都是看过10遍以上的老友记超级粉丝！</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本期是在b站播出第一季时录的，本来等着第二季上线时一起上线，结果…………）</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后一段是老友记super fan quiz! 如果你也碰巧是的话，请加入我们一起猜一猜呀😃</span></p><span></span><p><span>划重点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a> 第一次看老友记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="325">05:25</a> 当初中女生遇上绝望主妇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="422">07:02</a> 留学时的六个朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="599">09:59</a> 失眠人的白噪音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="681">11:21</a> 当代魔都女青年和莫妮卡的共同境遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="924">15:24</a> 不同人物的戏剧性和日常性维度分配</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1152">19:12</a> 穿上菲比穿搭，就像登上去迪士尼的11号线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1236">20:36</a> 一起做几题老友记super fan quiz！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1545">25:45</a> 希望小朋友也像老友记里面一样对待身边的Joey</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1602">26:42</a> 就像Rachel，复杂是可爱的</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>Angela</span></p><span></span><p><span>老友记20级学者，职业洞察搜集者，擅长文化趋势品牌定位，热爱梧桐树</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span>嚼软糖的米娜</span></p><span></span><p><span>心里住着一个爱嚼软糖的侠女，60岁的时候会是哈利波特伦敦片场最慈祥的志愿者小奶奶👵🏻</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/58c27c0f6a6a6905530195f6" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/58c27c0f6a6a6905530195f6"><span>嚼软糖的米娜</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Welcome to the real world.</span></p><span></span><p><span>It sucks, but you’re gonna love it.</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期除老友记之外被提及的剧集：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hot In Cleveland 燃情克利夫兰</span></p><span></span><p><span>Desperate Housewives 绝望主妇</span></p><span></span><p><span>How I Met Your Mother 老爸老妈浪漫史</span></p>]]></description>
