  <item>
    <title>饲养巨蜥、德国自驾、搜寻50年代老车 - “直男风”酷女孩的日常</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61e762680c35c9f95dca1248</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61e762680c35c9f95dca1248</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Jan 2022 00:59:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>或许我们都曾有过家养一个“怪兽”的想象、想要独自自驾横穿几个国家、搜寻一件古着上一个主人的生平过往……</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个周日的下午，我和这位背着小相机、刚玩完飞盘的“直男风”酷女孩塔哥来到梧桐树下的小咖啡馆，聊了聊她的日常</span></p><span></span><p><span>划重点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="162">02:42</a> 在云南沙溪开山路横翻进沟里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="312">05:12</a> 为什么只喜欢五六十年代的复古车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="457">07:37</a> 五六十年代的车好看是因为设计师不那么卷吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> 找寻中古的家具的快乐过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a> 古代工艺的耐穿性，和穿着“死者”穿过衣服结婚的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="966">16:06</a> 想养个怪兽，于是饲养了平原巨蜥和鳄龟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1105">18:25</a> 与“冷血动物”也可以有互动体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1464">24:24</a> 精确到点毫米的美妆刷选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1709">28:29</a> 硬核美妆博主的崛起</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>Angela</span></p><span></span><p><span>职业洞察搜集者，喜欢深度聊天，擅长文化趋势分析、品牌策略</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span>塔哥</span></p><span></span><p><span>梦想是在乌鲁木齐南路开Toyota 2000GT，下班卖顶级红烧肉taco</span></p><span></span><p><span>instagram: ritasky</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljy5vO25mDj3a4oo6LRmdO9VgX3w.m4a" length="31920024" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:32:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZvRDltbXRmYmF1Y2U4VFlQQkhzNzA2Z2NuS0IucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>和在网红路上做研究的她聊聊现代文青、文学日常和理想主义</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61d39c5d2654166e94d07cfc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61d39c5d2654166e94d07cfc</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Jan 2022 01:01:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新年快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在2022开年，和从体制内跳出换了6家公司又回到体制内做文学研究的她聊聊，在梧桐树下咖啡馆谈谈“躲进小楼成一统”的快乐、“现代文青”的变迁、变了又没变的理想主义。</span></p><span></span><p><span>划重点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a> “躲进小楼成一统”的文学研究日常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">05:29</a> 在体制内做文学就不卷了吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="719">11:59</a> 从文青到每个人都是文青</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="966">16:06</a> 对文化的伪追求也是好事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1053">17:33</a> 新“网红”文化人真的普及了吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1301">21:41</a> 从隐性到显性的理想主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">23:15</a> 换了六家公司后，发现自己最有价值的产出是当年的硕士论文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1447">24:07</a> 消费没法再满足我了，我想创作</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>Angela</span></p><span></span><p><span>职业洞察搜集者，喜欢深度聊天，擅长文化趋势分析、品牌策略</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱米粒</span></p><span></span><p><span>文学爱好者及研究者</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqLn9S0ZoWmvUI6cle_MAy3afsbp.m4a" length="25827637" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:26:19</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpGCO1ocjF3RxZuSn2X5J8KfVbh_.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>脱发“互助会”、消失的中年、性功能障碍和女性凝视</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61bfd7ae2d223855ed0af590</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61bfd7ae2d223855ed0af590</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 20 Dec 2021 01:09:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>本期对谈意识流流向</span></h2><span></span><p><span>脱发 - 社交影响 - 失控感 - 消失的中年 - 对中年的刻板印象 - 痘痘 - 女性凝视 - 互相凝视 - 男性护肤品牌角色 - 性功能障碍 - 去药化 - 焦虑的边际效应 - 现代男性气质</span></p><span></span><h2><span>划重点</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="178">02:58</a> 脱发“互助会”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">06:17</a> 脱发就像坐在一辆刹车坏了的加速的车上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="444">07:24</a> 30岁的人有近一半认为自己已进入衰老</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="766">12:46</a> 女性是男性容貌的监督者和老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="878">14:38</a> 彼此凝视的现代男性和女性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1178">19:38</a> 品牌也可以不用父权式的话语对待男性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1286">21:26</a> 性功能障碍者想要什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1426">23:46</a> 加分项，而非帮他及格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1547">25:47</a> 男性气质的变迁</span></p><span></span><h2><span>主播</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Angela</span></p><span></span><p><span>职业洞察搜集者，喜欢深度聊天，擅长文化趋势分析、品牌策略</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shawn</span></p><span></span><p><span>人类观察研究员</span></p><span></span><p><span>个人主页：</span><a href="http://liusletter.com/" data-url="http://liusletter.com/"><span>liusletter.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
